[ZipArchive.CreateAsync](/en-us/dotnet/api/system.io.compression.ziparchive.createasync) now eagerly loads all ZIP archive entries during the method call. This change ensures that accessing the [ZipArchive.Entries](/en-us/dotnet/api/system.io.compression.ziparchive.entries#system-io-compression-ziparchive-entries) property doesn't perform synchronous reads on the underlying stream, which aligns with asynchronous programming patterns.

